From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BDK Patches <patches@bdk.invalid>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 15:51:25 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] bdk: export the test hook for browser-owned surfaces from the
 framework

The BDK engine has one more test hook (bdk_testing_ui in
//bdk/engine/bdk_testing.h in the BDK repository): it scripts the
default presenters of the browser-owned surfaces (permission prompts,
JavaScript dialogs, HTTP authentication, file pickers, notifications),
drives find in page, and reads the site setting a permission decision
left. The engine scenario tests for those surfaces run against the
packaged runtime through it, so the framework must export it. It is not
the C ABI and gives a page nothing: it acts as the application, on the
application's own pages.

List it in chrome/app/framework.exports and, before _ChromeMain, in
framework.order, after the other test hooks (a patch of its own so the
list of hooks of the earlier patch stays as it was).

Used by: packages/core/tests/harness_engine.mm and the engine scenario
tests in the BDK repository.
---
 chrome/app/framework.exports | 4 ++++
 chrome/app/framework.order   | 3 +++
 2 files changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/chrome/app/framework.exports b/chrome/app/framework.exports
index 93a5fc01549ced7a9adb13ba51d3345503a750fc..44ea4f5cc1d2eeb4bac983a67de59597c5ae2d51 100644
--- a/chrome/app/framework.exports
+++ b/chrome/app/framework.exports
@@ -115,3 +115,7 @@ _bdk_testing_script_navigation
 _bdk_testing_simulate_key
 _bdk_testing_tab_info
 _bdk_testing_withdraw_ui_requests
+
+# BDK: the engine's test hook for the browser-owned surfaces
+# (//bdk/engine/bdk_testing.h). Not ABI.
+_bdk_testing_ui
diff --git a/chrome/app/framework.order b/chrome/app/framework.order
index 2f0b6339615bd6615b38881c9aff237d28a28af1..46a40e307dc604a8263a821dd736a10dba8f8191 100644
--- a/chrome/app/framework.order
+++ b/chrome/app/framework.order
@@ -124,6 +124,9 @@ _bdk_testing_simulate_key
 _bdk_testing_tab_info
 _bdk_testing_withdraw_ui_requests
 
+# BDK: the engine's test hook for the browser-owned surfaces.
+_bdk_testing_ui
+
 # _ChromeMain must be listed last.  That's the whole point of this file.
 _ChromeMain
 
